{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/azurelinux/3.0/image/minimal-os","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:12:15.843Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/azurelinux/3.0/image/minimal-os/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/azurelinux/3.0/image/minimal-os/about"},"readme":"## About\n\nThis repository contains the Azure Linux Minimal-OS image.\n\n### What is Azure Linux?\n\nAzure Linux is a Linux distribution for Microsoft’s cloud infrastructure and edge products and services. Azure Linux is designed to provide a consistent platform for these devices and services and will enhance Microsoft’s ability to stay current on Linux updates.  \n\nTo learn more about Azure Linux, refer to our [GitHub repository](https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/).\n\n### What is Azure Linux Minimal-OS?\n\nAzure Linux Minimal-OS is a minimal Azure Linux disk image that serves as a basic version of our Azure Linux image. It is designed to be small and fast. It includes only the necessary components, making it ideal for users who need a simple base that they can customize further for specific uses using Image Customizer container.\n\n## Usage\n\nDepending on which Azure Linux Minimal-OS version you want to use, replace `<release_version>` and `<tag>`.\n\n    oras pull mcr.microsoft.com/azurelinux/<release_version>/image/minimal-os:<tag>\n\nFor example,\n\n    oras pull mcr.microsoft.com/azurelinux/2.0/image/minimal-os:latest\n    oras pull mcr.microsoft.com/azurelinux/2.0/image/minimal-os:2.0.20240609\n    oras pull mcr.microsoft.com/azurelinux/3.0/image/minimal-os:3.0.20240609\n    oras pull mcr.microsoft.com/azurelinux/3.0/image/minimal-os:3.0.20240609-rc\n\n## Support\n\nAzure Linux container images are supported for both internal Microsoft use and public discovery. For more information, please see our [Support Statement](https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/-/SUPPORT.md).\n\n## License\n\nThe Azure Linux distribution is provided under the [MIT license](https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/-/LICENSE). Individual packages and components are governed by their own licenses included in the package sources available via srpm on [packages.microsoft.com](https://packages.microsoft.com/azurelinux/) or via our [GitHub repository](https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/).\n\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-09-14T18:49:16.8376541+00:00","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":"MIT","links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"111K+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:31fd403aaf500c42516b73257eb74e2b874ac5f8750c0251965dee775bedb652","pushed":"2026-09-14T18:45:39.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"3.0.20260909","digest":"sha256:31fd403aaf500c42516b73257eb74e2b874ac5f8750c0251965dee775bedb652","pushed":"2026-09-14T18:45:37.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"3.0.20260909-arm64","digest":"sha256:13ce8c85a7ba53ecaece8a83dabb15687a8108b6ef18959a130ce2fdc0d76795","pushed":"2026-09-14T18:39:15.0000000+00:00","size":40,"platforms":["linux/arm64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.manifest.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"3.0.20260909-amd64","digest":"sha256:e943042dda0217e3c7ef12807259e8ba075455c3f454c8140e0bdc2abf973c4b","pushed":"2026-09-14T18:11:09.0000000+00:00","size":40,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.manifest.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"3.0.20260809","digest":"sha256:8afcfd7ec9cc257fd18176b45a5b71afac649f534592636f65bb57f4e18da15a","pushed":"202